00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.610
- And this one I love

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:45.250
because it's just gentle and hydrating.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:48.742
- Exactly, I am totally loving
this retinal 24 by Olay.

00:02:48.742 --> 00:02:51.700
It is super hydrating and
it's such a good price

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.840
