00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.750
So retinol is basically vitamin A.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.460
So if you think about like the
vitamin A foods that we eat,

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.880
like carrots and you know,
sweet potatoes and stuff,

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.720
it's that same compound.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.040
So it's also a vitamin that it really

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.540
